            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Determination of amounts to be paid shall be calculated by multiplying the daily rate of pay for the supplement times the number of days worked in the designated coaching season. If the employee had completed all of the requirements of the supplement, the unpaid balance shall be included in the last supplemental paycheck.",
