            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. A teacher holding a supplemented position may voluntarily relinquish the position provided the teacher notifies his supervisor at the earliest possible date. The supervisor will notify the teacher as soon as feasible if the teacher will be terminated in the supplemented position. If the supplement receiver is terminated, the reason(s) will be provided upon request.",
