        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Supplement receivers may be granted temporary duty leave for all out of county activities as indicated on the schedule of activities filed with the worksite supervisor and the Program Consultant for Extracurricular Activities by submitting leave papers to the worksite supervisor or the Board.",
